Deployment for Mobile Access

Current: `localhost:8358`

Target: `https://yourdomain.com` (public, SSL, scalable)

Infrastructure stack:

Layer	Tool	Purpose	
DNS + CDN	Cloudflare	SSL termination, DDoS protection, static asset caching	
Load Balancer	Nginx / AWS ALB	WebSocket sticky sessions, SSL	
App Servers	Gunicorn + Eventlet	Flask-SocketIO workers (scale horizontally)	
Message Bus	Redis	SocketIO cross-server pub/sub, session store	
Database	PostgreSQL	Campaign state, user accounts, persistent storage	
File Storage	S3 / MinIO	Graphic packs, portraits, module assets	
AI Proxy	Internal service	Rate limiting, caching, fallback models	

Docker Compose for production:

```yaml
version: '3.8'
services:
  nginx:
    image: nginx:alpine
    ports:
      - "443:443"
    volumes:
      - ./nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf
      - ./ssl:/etc/nginx/ssl
  
  app:
    build: .
    environment:
      - REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379
      - DATABASE_URL=postgresql://db:5432/neq
      - OPENAI_API_KEY=${OPENAI_API_KEY}
    deploy:
      replicas: 3  # Scale horizontally
  
  redis:
    image: redis:7-alpine
    volumes:
      - redis_data:/data
  
  postgres:
    image: postgres:15
    volumes:
      - pg_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data
    environment:
      - POSTGRES_PASSWORD=${DB_PASSWORD}
```

